    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Changes which rows a nightly privacy sweep reads and how a bounded read reports: a wrong cursor leaves evidence of deleted rules unredacted for good; task 204/209 truncation rules and the job's health signal must stay honest.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>deferred-fixes-2026-11-25d</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>SignalClosureService.DeletedPolicyCodesWithSignalsAsync and SignalReevaluationJob.RedactSignalsOfDeletedPoliciesAsync and their tests; task 223 edits a different site (~962) of SignalReevaluationJob.cs: merge master before merging if 223 lands first.</parallel-reason>
